In the lab trans.sv, what is the purpose of this macro
`uvm_object_utils(packet)

Answer:
The macro is used to register the class type with the Factory which enables two main actions:
1. Creation of an instance using packet::type_id::create
2. Type (instance) override with an extending class
Also with `uvm_object_utils_begin(packet), built-in methods such as do_copy can be used to operate on the class data elements
  `uvm_object_utils_begin(packet)
    `uvm_field_int(opcode,UVM_ALL_ON)
    `uvm_field_int(id,UVM_ALL_ON)
  `uvm_object_utils_end

